# The ALB is internal and only reached by CloudFront's VPC origin; TLS terminates at CloudFront.
AVD-AWS-0054
# The state bucket uses SSE-S3; the state holds no secret values (secrets are set out of band), so a KMS key adds cost, not protection.
AVD-AWS-0132
# Alarm emails carry no secrets, and CloudWatch cannot publish to a topic encrypted with the AWS-managed SNS key.
AVD-AWS-0095
